  "interpretation": [
    "Pure function-fitted coordinates are not repaired by shrinking them toward the rotational parent. The smallest radius already retains only 0.723x the weight recovery of task/weight shear.",
    "Radius 0.25 is the first point to meet the 1.10x MLP-output gate on both windows and it improves post-GELU recovery, but CE descent is only about 0.91x and weight recovery 0.677x.",
